cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Exam Clock: a projected clock for written examinations"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, dependency-free wall clock for the exam room. It shows the time
  of day on an analogue dial together with the start, end, elapsed and remaining
  time of the examination. Every field is editable during the exam, the clock can
  be paused for interruptions, and it runs with no server and no network.
type: software
